  "assumptions": "Isolated worlds, normal NPC simulation. All trials start with the same granted capital and starter fleet; one additional miner starts at the field. C adds one corvette; D adds one destroyer, two corvettes, and a managed hauler. D escorts stay with the mining group, not the hauler. A mines Kestrel into Astra; B/C mine Blackgate into Drakeout; D hauls the rare ore to Astra. NPCs buy only their existing market goods. A separate fixture-funded player offers to buy singular ore at 220 cr/unit whenever it arrives; inventory and cash are finite, so unsold material is never revenue. Ships and test funds are grants, not earnings. Cash debit includes all player fleet operating costs and any unclassified cash changes; lost ships are charged at the game hull list reference, not a guaranteed replacement quote. Activities are sampled every 10 seconds. No valuation of unsold inventory or initial grants is included in net cash.",
